#== News

== About me
I am a PhD student in the Paul G. Allen School of Computer Science & Engineering at UC San Diego, advised by Ioana Dumitriu and Todd Kemp. 
I have an M.Sc. degree in Mathematics from Texas A&M University, supervised by Michael Anshelevich, and B.Sc. degree in Mathematics from Beihang University.

#== Education 

== Research Interests 
- Statistical Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Point Process, Optimization, Fairness
- Data Mining, Information Retrieval, Recommender System 
- Computer Vision, Computer Graphics, Natural Language Processing

